@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber
title To add a publication genre to the genre list

actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

Administrator -> System : I want to add a new genre to the official list
activate System
Administrator <-- System : What is the genre name?
deactivate System
Administrator -> System : genreName
activate System
System --> Administrator : Genre successfully added!
deactivate System

@enduml